00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.469
So we're going to go through that trade.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:45.019
So after we do the trade,
we're going to be making two

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.770
completely different components.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:52.500
So we're going to bring it back over
the, um, the benzene ring here, right?

